1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,171
I love my childhood.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,811
I grew up playing with the neighbours' children.

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,891
We played and played.

4
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,531
In our neighbourhood, only one house had a television.

5
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:34,891
We would all gather and watch the drama Gemena together.

6
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:47,291
And afterwards, we would talk about the drama.

7
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:56,571
Now, when I think of my childhood, I feel joy, not regret.

8
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:05,665
There is a big difference between children who played and those who didn't.

9
00:01:05,665 --> 00:01:11,011
Children who never played find it hard to get along with people.

10
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:16,011
So let children play.
